# Per-developer Claude Code state. NOT the shared config: .claude/settings.json,
# rules/, hooks/, skills/, agents/ and plans/ are all committed on purpose —
# they are how this project is built and reviewed, and publishing them is part
# of the transparency posture. Only the machine-local bits are excluded.
#
# settings.local.json was previously ignored ONLY by the founder's global
# gitignore, which a contributor cloning this repo would not have.
# Glob, not an exact match: the editor writes
# settings.local.json.tmp.<pid>.<hash> alongside it, and `git add -A` would
# happily stage one of those.
.claude/settings.local.json*
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
