# Google service-account credentials for the updates-list Sheet mirror
# (ADR 0011). Referenced by GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON; server/local only,
# never in the client bundle. The secrets guard blocks these by filename and
# by content shape as well — belt and braces, because one leak is permanent.
service-account*.json
*.service-account.json
gcp-key*.json
google-credentials*.json

# never let local backups get tracked
onerhythm-backups/
